39: * in FIFO discovery order (root key order, then each selected version's dependency
40: * key order). Discovery collects its constraints immediately. When a name is
41: * unselected, try its versions from numerically highest to lowest satisfying ALL
42: * constraints collected so far. A newly discovered or processed conflict
